        {
          "type": "appStoreVersionLocalizations",
          "id": "113e952d-fe3e-497d-bd52-bd4e3acb46bc",
          "attributes": {
            "description": "Remember what you lifted last time. Strength Save is a workout log for recording weights, reps and rest periods, planning your sessions and following your progress.\n\nDuring your workout\n\u2022 Your previous result beside each set to help you choose a weight.\n\u2022 Working sets, warm-up sets, supersets and notes.\n\u2022 Rest timer notifications when your screen is locked, with notification permission enabled.\n\u2022 Quick workouts when you want to train without a program.\n\u2022 Offline workout logging that syncs when your connection returns.\n\nPlan the weeks ahead\nChoose from 25 programs or build your own. Browse 243 exercises with written instructions. Reschedule sessions, swap exercises and keep the history of your previous training cycles.\n\nSee your progress\nCompare weeks and months, check your exercise history and track personal records. Review completed workouts, sets and training volume. Add body measurements if you also want to follow changes in your physique.\n\niPhone, iPad and Apple Watch\nThe Apple Watch app works with your iPhone. Log sets and follow rest periods on your watch. Review plans and results on iPad. Optional Apple Health integration lets you save completed workouts and read body weight. You choose which permissions to grant.\n\nBring your training history\nImport workout CSV files from Strong or Hevy. Export your data and create PDF reports. Use the app in English or Polish.\n\nPRO subscription\nThe app is free to download. Starting workouts requires active PRO access, such as a subscription or trial. Monthly and annual plans are available. The price and any eligible trial appear before you confirm the purchase. Subscriptions renew automatically unless cancelled before renewal. Manage your subscription in your Apple account settings.\n\nSupport: https://strengthsave.app/support\nPrivacy: https://strengthsave.app/privacy\nTerms: https://strengthsave.app/terms\nApple Terms of Use: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/",
            "locale": "en-US",
            "keywords": "weightlifting,routine,sets,reps,rest,timer,progress,bodybuilding,powerlifting,offline,hypertrophy",
            "marketingUrl": "https://strengthsave.app/?lang=en",
            "promotionalText": "Log your sets, check last time's weights and follow your progress. Choose a program or build your own. Train with your iPhone or Apple Watch.",
            "supportUrl": "https://strengthsave.app/support",
            "whatsNew": null
          },
